				"⠁⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				76,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Grove): Correct license badge and reference URLs\n\nUpdate the `README.md` to point to the correct repository context for the LICENSE file. The previous links incorrectly referenced the `Land` root repository, whereas Grove is a distinct submodule.\n\nChange both the badge link and the inline license text reference to use `CodeEditorLand/Grove` instead of `CodeEditorLand/Land`. This ensures users are directed to the correct license file hosted within the Grove project directory.",
			"SHA": "51f0b01b606986bf46512010aeac3ad6d7fc6973"
